Z||000000||TOM||07-26-2000||01:14 AM||||I found out the hard way that the rubberized fabric stuff used as a wayer shield behind the wheel wells will eat through the radiator hose. The lower on the driver side. I went out o the car and found a puddle. Looked and found a cut in the hose from rubbing on this shielding. So check yours.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Oreif||07-26-2000||01:17 AM||||Thanks Tom I'll check first thing in the A.M.<BR>||||reg||1
